From: OpenHarmony PC Developer Community <dev@openharmony.org>
Date: 2026-03-27
Subject: [PATCH] posixmodule.c: handle NULL offset for sendfile on HarmonyOS

Add __OHOS__ to platform guard for sendfile NULL offset handling.

Applies to: CPython 3.9.0
---
--- a/Modules/posixmodule.c	2020-10-05 23:07:58.000000000 +0800
+++ b/Modules/posixmodule.c	2026-03-25 10:54:11.537045468 +0800
@@ -9437,7 +9437,7 @@
     #endif
 
 #else
-#ifdef __linux__
+#if defined(__linux__) || defined(__OHOS__)
     if (offobj == Py_None) {
         do {
             Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS
